      "Abstract": {
        "CopyrightInformation": "Copyright © 2008 Elsevier Ireland Ltd. All rights reserved.",
        "AbstractText": "Stent fracture (SF) has been found in peripheral and coronary vasculatures, and in the latter mostly after implantation of sirolimus- or paclitaxel-eluting stents. We report a patient with a fractured stent associated with restenosis after zotarolimus-eluting stent (ZES) implantation which was confirmed by fluoroscopy, intravascular ultrasound and computerized tomography. To our knowledge, this is the first published report of SF after ZES implantation."
      },
